OL,3,AWhite House restores access to media
OL,4,Aoutlets banned by Trump after judge's
OL,5,Aorder
OL,6,
OL,7,FCNN, Politico and MS NOW are back in
OL,8,Fthe White House, hours after a federal
OL,9,Fjudge ruled President Donald Trump's
OL,10,Fban on the three news outlets was
OL,11,Fprobably unconstitutional and ordered
OL,12,Ftheir access immediately restored.
OL,14,FThe outlets sought an emergency court
OL,15,Fhearing to regain entry accusing the
OL,16,FWhite House in a court filing of having
OL,17,F"repeatedly violated" the judge's
OL,18,Fruling by turning away their
OL,19,Fjournalists. The hearing was called off
OL,20,Fafter access was restored.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,165,160,200,105,0,100
